I think you want to do:

qplot(as.factor(Yr_Form),statgroup,fill=filestat,data=filstat,geom="bar",stat="identity")

Note that (i) I'm using qplot, because I'm lazy, (ii) no need for a
dev.new <http://dev.new>(), and (iii) the stat="identity" part was the crucial missing
bit. You can read about this on the help page for geom_bar.

Ben

