Michael, you could plot your labels ("0", "600", "5000", "10000",
"15000") and then use an additional geom_text call

+geom_text( x, y, label="phantom(x) >= phantom(y) ", parse=T )

...where x and y will put the label in exactly the right spot (i.e.
before 15000). This is a terrible, awful kludgey hack, but will at
least give you your figure.

Ben

