I didn't get >= 15000, I got something like ( =, 15000) instead. Just
now, in a fresh R session, I tried it again and now it works. Must be
that Ista magic :)

library('ggplot2')

lab <- c("0", "600", "5000", "10000", "phantom(x) >= 15000")

pts <- data.frame(x = 1.2, y = seq(0.6, 1.4, by = 0.2), lab = lab)

qplot(1, 1) +
    geom_text(data = pts, aes(x = x, y = y, label = lab), parse = TRUE) +
    xlim(0.6, 1.4)

Dennis

