Hi:

Here's one approach assuming version 0.9.x:

library('ggplot2')
library('scales')

ggplot(Data, aes(x = x, y = y)) +

      geom_point(aes(size = abs(z)), shape = 15) +
      scale_x_continuous(labels = dollar) +
      scale_y_continuous(labels = dollar) +
      scale_size(labels = dollar, range = c(1, 20))

Adjust the range to taste.

Dennis

